  ('fleet_quality_index', 'operational', 'target',
   'share of metric triggers that hold a value and are on target, 0..100 (quality_trend scope fleet). Trigger exemption: the portfolio manager acts on it every hour (a program whose index falls 5 points in 24 h is escalated), so a METRIC-TRIGGER issue would duplicate that action',
   'qnfo-audit.quality_trend (MANAGEMENT-PERSONAS-3), written hourly by fleet_tasks management-personas',
