  ('issue_reopens_7d', 'operational', 'target',
   'issue_lifecycle reopened events in the last 7 days (issue_recurrence_now). Trigger exemption: each family reopened 5 or more times gets its own ROOT-CAUSE-1 issue from the managers, which is the action a trigger would take',
